REMARK 280 CRYSTALLIZATION CONDITIONS: CRYSTALS OF SIRT2 IN COMPLEX WITH FLS    
REMARK 280  -359 WERE OBTAINED USING HANGING-DROP VAPOUR DIFFUSION SETUPS.      
REMARK 280  SIRT2 AT A CONCENTRATION OF 21.9 MG/ML (50 MM HEPES-NAOH, 150 MM    
REMARK 280  NACL, PH 8.0) WAS PREINCUBATED WITH 3.6 MM (5.7-FOLD MOLAR          
REMARK 280  EXCESS) OF FLS-359 (100 MM IN DMSO) FOR 1 H. 1 UL OF THE PROTEIN    
REMARK 280  SOLUTION WAS THEN MIXED WITH 2 UL OF RESERVOIR SOLUTION (0.1 M      
REMARK 280  HEPES-NAOH PH 6.6, 0.3 M LI2SO4, 21 % (W/V) PEG 3350) AND STREAK    
REMARK 280  SEEDED BEFORE BEING EQUILIBRATED AT 20C OVER 0.2 ML OF RESERVOIR    
REMARK 280  SOLUTION. WELL DIFFRACTING CRYSTALS GREW AS THICK AGGREGATES OF     
REMARK 280  THIN PLATES AND WERE MOUNTED WITHIN 19 DAYS, VAPOR DIFFUSION,       
REMARK 280  HANGING DROP, TEMPERATURE 293.15K                                   
